  "question": {
    "text": "A plane <math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> passes through the line of intersection of the planes&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If the plane <math><mi>P</mi></math> divides the line joining <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> in the ratio <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math> internally and the&nbsp; equation of the plane is <math><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math> where <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>c</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
