  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The equation of the plane is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />A point which divides&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> in <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math> internally is</p><p><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />This point must satisfy the equation of the plane</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Equation of the required plane is <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p>",
